WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.650
- If you really do have
witchcraft at your disposal,

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.639
then why don't you just abracadabra

00:00:07.639 --> 00:00:12.639
that goddamn bitch out
of my afterlife, huh?

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.780
I'm sorry for your loss (chaws)

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.660
You want a bite?

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.220
This is shite!

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.360
Pure shite!

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.330
Where are the writers, huh?

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.163
The writers!

00:00:25.163 --> 00:00:27.050
Are you hiding? I shouldn't blame you.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.100
I couldn't toast a piece of bread

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.610
with the heat they were putting on you.

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.880
I just wanted to bring these
by as a little peace offering

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.772
for Addy disturbing your slumber.

00:00:37.772 --> 00:00:39.317
- Thank you.
- I think I'm gonna have to

00:00:39.317 --> 00:00:41.317
start strapping her in at night--

00:00:41.317 --> 00:00:46.260
For a man whose profession
relies on talk, talk, talk,

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.440
you appear to be at a
loss for words, Doctor.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:52.273
What's the matter? Cat got your tongue?

00:00:53.258 --> 00:00:57.237
Now there's one thing you
learn before leaving this place

00:00:57.237 --> 00:01:01.040
it's that we, even the weakest

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.013
among us,

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.480
are better than the best of them.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:07.534
I have grieved enough for two lifetimes.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:12.534
Most people would be broken by
the deaths of their children,

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.560
but my nature would not
permit such weakness.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.023
I am not the same as everyone.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.656
You brought death into this place

00:01:22.656 --> 00:01:23.739
and for that,

00:01:25.395 --> 00:01:26.940
you must pay.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:31.383
I also remember every time
I see that ghostly eye,

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:35.726
that I was and continue to be

00:01:35.726 --> 00:01:37.833
a hell of a shot.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.640
So that was twenty lashes each,

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.150
so that makes forty for you,

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:45.983
Sir Galahad.

00:01:47.897 --> 00:01:50.550
(eerie music)

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:54.490
Once I discovered that he had cheated,

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:58.149
Hugo meant no more to me than dog shit.

00:01:58.149 --> 00:02:00.890
You know, I've never
understood you Bible-thumpers

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.383
and your hypocrisy towards sex.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:07.760
I know, behind closed doors,

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.663
you are the biggest perverts of all.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:14.480
I would kill or die for you,

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:15.730
but I will not

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:18.480
share the affections of the
men I bring into this house

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.410
with any woman, you understand?

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.210
I've lived a disreputable life.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:23.980
But I've done it in style,

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.710
and I'll die likewise.

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:29.423
I wouldn't shed a tear if you were to die.

00:02:30.559 --> 00:02:32.563
Not because you're a freak,

00:02:34.992 --> 00:02:37.107
but because you betrayed me.

00:02:37.107 --> 00:02:39.490
You were sloppy, little witch bitch.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.143
- Go to hell, you stupid hag.

00:02:42.198 --> 00:02:47.198
(eerie music)
(whoosh)

00:02:47.264 --> 00:02:49.485
(bang)

00:02:49.485 --> 00:02:51.735
- Oh, they're not for you.

00:02:51.735 --> 00:02:53.360
At your age?

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.660
You may as well just

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:57.003
crazy-glue a stick of butter to your ass.

00:02:57.952 --> 00:02:59.443
- Are you in charge here?

00:02:59.443 --> 00:03:01.414
- I'm Fiona Goode (chuckles).

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.479
(whispers) I'm in charge everywhere.

00:03:03.479 --> 00:03:04.950
- I love you.
- Ewh.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.247
- Why do you look so jet-lagged?

00:03:08.247 --> 00:03:10.210
- I happen to look wonderful.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.880
- And when they dig up that
backyard and find my bones,

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.590
you'll go to prison.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:18.230
- There's not going to be a
swimming pool, you stupid slut.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.460
Ah yes, you know I've read
your columns about baked beans,

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.723
gallivanting geese who
lost their way home.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:25.613
Riveting.

00:03:25.613 --> 00:03:28.366
Too bad your ambition
outweighs your talent.

00:03:28.366 --> 00:03:30.759
You can go as Snoopy again.

00:03:30.759 --> 00:03:32.400
The costume will still fit

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.000
if you lay off those chocolate chips.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.190
- [Stanley] Please, please, please.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:39.270
- You tried to kill my dreams,
but they cannot be murdered.

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.115
- He's dead and I'm here, and I'm alive

00:03:41.115 --> 00:03:42.720
and I still love you!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.733
- That's your problem.

00:03:43.733 --> 00:03:47.381
- Have you any idea with
whom you are speaking?

00:03:47.381 --> 00:03:48.970
- Yes.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:52.336
The maid, unless you
wanna go back in the box.

00:03:52.336 --> 00:03:54.380
Dr. Thredson,

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.033
you are but a guest in our institution.

00:03:57.033 --> 00:04:00.523
Don't wear out your welcome the first day.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.410
They are a part of me,

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:06.159
just like that unborn
child is a part of me

00:04:06.159 --> 00:04:08.692
and I will not have you
put your filthy hands

00:04:08.692 --> 00:04:10.540
on my grandchild.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.565
- He's a deity, show some respect.

00:04:12.565 --> 00:04:16.620
(whoosh)
(chokes)

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.355
- Respect is something

00:04:18.355 --> 00:04:20.280
that is definitely lacking around here,

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.346
I will grant you that.

00:04:22.346 --> 00:04:24.293
Sorry about all this.

00:04:27.184 --> 00:04:29.709
You touch my kid one more time

00:04:29.709 --> 00:04:32.556
and I will break your goddamn arm.

00:04:32.556 --> 00:04:33.389
(door slams)
(sirens wail)

00:04:33.389 --> 00:04:34.770
So, Detective,

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:37.635
what false accusation have
you prepared for us now?

00:04:37.635 --> 00:04:40.283
(loud bangs)
Idiots.

00:04:40.283 --> 00:04:42.027
(whoosh)

00:04:42.027 --> 00:04:44.781
(bangs)

00:04:44.781 --> 00:04:46.833
Now, likely I won't have the upper body

00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:49.870
strength to saw you in half

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:52.970
the way you did my poor Travis,

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:54.144
but I certainly

00:04:54.144 --> 00:04:56.260
could cut off

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:57.867
the smaller parts!

00:04:57.867 --> 00:04:59.700
- No, no, no, no, no

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.743
- In about ten seconds,

00:05:01.743 --> 00:05:05.080
I'm gonna turn the heat up in
that chubby melon of yours,

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:08.046
and I'm gonna turn your
brains to scrambled eggs.

00:05:08.046 --> 00:05:09.440
(gulps)

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.510
But Frankly,

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.680
it's been a hard morning,

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.842
and I'd really rather not work up a sweat.

00:05:14.842 --> 00:05:16.870
(nervous gulps)

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.140
I bet the kiddies scatter
like little buggies

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:20.857
when you walk down the street.

00:05:20.857 --> 00:05:22.550
(splash)

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.743
It's all my business, you prick.

00:05:26.014 --> 00:05:27.100
(spits)

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:29.330
Who are you to talk to me like that?

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.774
I'd move if I were you,

00:05:30.774 --> 00:05:33.607
(low eerie music)

00:05:34.739 --> 00:05:36.902
Don't make me kill you again.

00:05:36.902 --> 00:05:38.530
Who do you think you are,

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:39.826
coming in here,

00:05:39.826 --> 00:05:44.826
swanning around, spewing vulgarities?

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:47.992
- We're the new owners, who are you?

00:05:47.992 --> 00:05:50.233
- I'm Constance Langdon.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:52.460
And this...

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.973
is my fucking house.

